Flagge: Türsteher. Taste a: Ampel. Taste q: Quiz. Taste u: und.</notes><thumbnail></thumbnail><stage name="Bühne" width="480" height="360" costume="0" tempo="60" threadsafe="false" penlog="false" volume="100" pan="0" lines="round" ternary="false" hyperops="true" codify="false" inheritance="true" sublistIDs="false" scheduled="false" id="1"><pentrails></pentrails><costumes><list id="2"></list></costumes><sounds><list id="3"></list></sounds><variables></variables><blocks></blocks><scripts></scripts><sprites select="1"><sprite name="Figur" idx="1" x="0" y="0" heading="90" scale="1" volume="100" pan="0" rotation="1" draggable="true" costume="0" color="80,80,80,1" pen="tip" id="8"><costumes><list id="9"></list></costumes><sounds><list id="10"></list></sounds><blocks></blocks><variables></variables><scripts><comment x="20" y="20" w="250" collapsed="false">Skript A (Flagge): Was sagt die Figur bei 17? Bei 18? Bei 40?</comment><script x="20" y="82"><block s="receiveGo"></block><block s="doAsk"><l>Wie alt bist du?</l></block><block s="doSetVar"><l>alter</l><block s="getLastAnswer"></block></block><block s="doIfElse"><block s="reportVariadicGreaterThanOrEquals"><list><block var="alter"/><l>18</l></list></block><script><block s="doSayFor"><l>Willkommen im Club!</l><l>2</l></block></script><script><block s="doSayFor"><l>Sorry, erst ab 18.</l><l>2</l></block></script></block></script><comment x="320" y="20" w="250" collapsed="false">Skript B (Taste a): Was passiert bei 'gelb'?</comment><script x="320" y="82"><block s="receiveKey"><l>a</l></block><block s="doAsk"><l>Ampel: rot, gelb oder grün?</l></block><block s="doSetVar"><l>farbe</l><block s="getLastAnswer"></block></block><block s="doIf"><block s="reportVariadicEquals"><list><block var="farbe"/><l>grün</l></list></block><script><block s="doSayFor"><l>Fahren!</l><l>2</l></block></script></block><block s="doIf"><block s="reportVariadicEquals"><list><block var="farbe"/><l>rot</l></list></block><script><block s="doSayFor"><l>Stopp!</l><l>2</l></block></script></block></script><comment x="20" y="290" w="250" collapsed="false">Skript C (Taste q): Quiz mit Punkten.</comment><script x="20" y="337"><block s="receiveKey"><l>q</l></block><block s="doAsk"><l>Hauptstadt von Bayern?</l></block><block s="doIfElse"><block s="reportVariadicEquals"><list><block s="getLastAnswer"></block><l>München</l></list></block><script><block s="doChangeVar"><l>punkte</l><l>1</l></block><block s="doSayFor"><l>Richtig!</l><l>2</l></block></script><script><block s="doSayFor"><l>Leider nein.</l><l>2</l></block></script></block></script><comment x="320" y="313" w="250" collapsed="false">Skript D (Taste u): Wann ist die Bedingung wahr?</comment><script x="320" y="375"><block s="receiveKey"><l>u</l></block><block s="doAsk"><l>Nenne eine Zahl:</l></block><block s="doSetVar"><l>zahl</l><block s="getLastAnswer"></block></block><block s="doIfElse"><block s="reportVariadicAnd"><list><block s="reportVariadicGreaterThan"><list><block var="zahl"/><l>0</l></list></block><block s="reportVariadicLessThan"><list><block var="zahl"/><l>10</l></list></block></list></block><script><block s="doSayFor"><l>einstellig und positiv</l><l>2</l></block></script><script><block s="doSayFor"><l>nicht einstellig oder nicht positiv</l><l>2</l></block></script></block></script></scripts></sprite><watcher var="punkte" style="normal" x="10" y="10" color="243,118,29"/></sprites></stage><hidden></hidden><headers></headers><code></code><blocks></blocks><variables><variable name="alter"><l>0</l></variable><variable name="farbe"><l></l></variable><variable name="punkte"><l>0</l></variable><variable name="zahl"><l>0</l></variable></variables></project>